    <span class="tag tag-cyan">Reinforcement Learning</span>
    <span class="tag tag-green">Interactive</span>
  </div>
  <h1>DFT: One-Line Fix That Turns SFT Into RL</h1>
  <p class="lead">Standard supervised fine-tuning silently applies a 1/p reward multiplier: tokens the model rarely predicts get gradient weights 10×, 50×, even 500× larger than common tokens. This distortion causes memorization instead of generalization. Dynamic Fine-Tuning cancels it with a single-line change — multiplying each token's loss by its own probability — and beats GRPO on math benchmarks without any reward model or sampling.</p>
